    "name": "Deno Deploy API v2 Logs API",
    "description": "The Deno Deploy REST API v2 enables programmatic management of applications, revisions, layers, and configuration on the Deno Deploy serverless edge platform.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Deno Deploy Support",
